  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35733852",
      "title": "Layouts & Nested Routes",
      "sourceHash": "3cf2c75009b0cbb73b4fb1cd40c2f193bf3ca3e5e440e7bf26f39c90abf7f05d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 5.16,
          "en": "So now, we added this link here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.16,
          "end": 9.06,
          "en": "Now, of course, this site is still pretty basic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.06,
          "end": 11.52,
          "en": "and it will stay relatively basic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.52,
          "end": 14.19,
          "en": "but there are some extra features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.19,
          "end": 16.59,
          "en": "we might want to add to it, nonetheless.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.59,
          "end": 18.03,
          "en": "Now, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.03,
          "end": 20.91,
          "en": "we might want to add a navigation bar at the top,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.91,
          "end": 22.68,
          "en": "which actually lets us navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.68,
          "end": 24.9,
          "en": "between the homepage and the products page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.9,
          "end": 26.31,
          "en": "That would be something you find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.31,
          "end": 28.92,
          "en": "on most websites, after all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.92,
          "end": 31.53,
          "en": "We also might wanna apply some default styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.53,
          "end": 33.45,
          "en": "and, for example, make sure that the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.45,
          "end": 36.12,
          "en": "doesn't sit right on the edges here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.12,
          "end": 38.94,
          "en": "Now for that, we could add a new component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.94,
          "end": 40.8,
          "en": "which I'll add in a components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 40.8,
          "end": 43.26,
          "en": "because I won't load it as a page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.26,
          "end": 46.59,
          "en": "Instead, I want to include it in other components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.59,
          "end": 49.32,
          "en": "And I'll name it main navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.32,
          "end": 54.12,
          "en": "So here, we can add a main navigation component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.12,
          "end": 57.42,
          "en": "and, of course, also export it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.42,
          "end": 59.7,
          "en": "And then here, we could return a header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.7,
          "end": 61.59,
          "en": "which contains a nav element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.59,
          "end": 63.42,
          "en": "which contains an unordered list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.42,
          "end": 66.54,
          "en": "where in every list item we have a link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.54,
          "end": 69.61,
          "en": "And for that, we, of course, want to import link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.47,
          "end": 73.503,
          "en": "from react-router-dom, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.94,
          "end": 77.01,
          "en": "And then here, we could have a home link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 77.01,
          "end": 79.68,
          "en": "and another list item with the products link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.68,
          "end": 80.513,
          "en": "And of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 80.513,
          "end": 83.01,
          "en": "we wanna set the appropriate paths here, as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.01,
          "end": 85.74,
          "en": "and go to slash nothing and slash products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.74,
          "end": 87.963,
          "en": "This could be our main navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.7,
          "end": 91.65,
          "en": "Now, this main navigation should, now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.65,
          "end": 93.96000000000001,
          "en": "be visible on all our pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 93.96000000000001,
          "end": 97.08,
          "en": "So therefore, of course, one thing we can do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.08,
          "end": 101.16,
          "en": "is we can go to home JS and import the main navigation there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.16,
          "end": 103.47,
          "en": "and then add it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.47,
          "end": 106.11,
          "en": "And do the same in the products JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.11,
          "end": 108.9,
          "en": "But of course, the more pages we're going to add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 108.9,
          "end": 111.09,
          "en": "the more we must repeat that step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 111.09,
          "end": 113.13,
          "en": "And whilst it would be possible to do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.13,
          "end": 115.56,
          "en": "it would also be a bit annoying.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.56,
          "end": 117.12,
          "en": "What we might wanna do instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 117.12,
          "end": 121.98,
          "en": "is add some layout that wraps all these routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 121.98,
          "end": 124.53,
          "en": "and that simply, kind of, loads",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 124.53,
          "end": 125.82,
          "en": "these route components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 125.82,
          "end": 129.213,
          "en": "inside of this wrapping layout component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 130.17,
          "end": 133.71,
          "en": "Now, you could try to render the navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 133.71,
          "end": 137.04,
          "en": "above this router provider component, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 137.04,
          "end": 139.92000000000002,
          "en": "or wrap this router provider component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 139.92000000000002,
          "end": 141.84,
          "en": "with another component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 141.84,
          "end": 143.79,
          "en": "but this would not work if you plan",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 143.79,
          "end": 146.82,
          "en": "to add links to your layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 146.82,
          "end": 149.82,
          "en": "because those links only work if they're rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 149.82,
          "end": 152.88,
          "en": "inside of the router provider, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 152.88,
          "end": 156.153,
          "en": "not above or next to it or as a wrapper of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 157.56,
          "end": 159.42000000000002,
          "en": "What you wanna do instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 159.42000000000002,
          "end": 163.41,
          "en": "and which can be quite difficult to understand at first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 163.41,
          "end": 165.75,
          "en": "but which is how you approach this problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 165.75,
          "end": 168.06,
          "en": "with react-router-dom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 168.06,
          "end": 172.11,
          "en": "is you add an extra route to your route definitions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 172.11,
          "end": 175.41,
          "en": "and you use a path of slash nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 175.41,
          "end": 179.57999999999998,
          "en": "And then here, you add an element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 179.57999999999998,
          "end": 183.45,
          "en": "that actually loads the layout wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 183.45,
          "end": 186.24,
          "en": "that should be wrapped around the other routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 186.24,
          "end": 189.48,
          "en": "And we'll do the wrapping part in a second step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 189.48,
          "end": 190.47,
          "en": "For a first step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 190.47,
          "end": 194.55,
          "en": "I'll add our root dot JS file here in pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 194.55,
          "end": 197.73,
          "en": "and name this root layout, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 197.73,
          "end": 200.073,
          "en": "and export this here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 201.27,
          "end": 205.74,
          "en": "And then, in here we'll soon add some JSX content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 205.74,
          "end": 210.393,
          "en": "For the moment, we'll just say layout, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 211.47,
          "end": 214.38,
          "en": "Now, this root layout component will be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 214.38,
          "end": 217.623,
          "en": "as the element for this route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 218.49,
          "end": 219.323,
          "en": "And for that, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 219.323,
          "end": 222.903,
          "en": "root layout is imported here in the app JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 224.85,
          "end": 227.52,
          "en": "Now, to actually wrap these two routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 227.52,
          "end": 230.52,
          "en": "and their components with this layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 230.52,
          "end": 234.84,
          "en": "we must add another property to this special route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 234.84,
          "end": 236.85,
          "en": "If you wanna call it like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 236.85,
          "end": 238.503,
          "en": "The children property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 239.73,
          "end": 241.38,
          "en": "That takes an array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 241.38,
          "end": 244.44,
          "en": "and it is actually an array of more route definitions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 244.44,
          "end": 247.713,
          "en": "and we can move these two route definitions into this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 249.18,
          "end": 252.51,
          "en": "With that, we make these two route definitions, here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 252.51,
          "end": 255.21,
          "en": "child route definitions of this route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 255.21,
          "end": 258.63,
          "en": "So, this route acts as a parent route to these routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 258.63,
          "end": 261.153,
          "en": "and it acts as a wrapper to these routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 262.17,
          "end": 266.37,
          "en": "In this parent route element, so in this root layout here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 266.37,
          "end": 267.99,
          "en": "we also have to define",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 267.99,
          "end": 270.99,
          "en": "where these child route components and elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 270.99,
          "end": 274.263,
          "en": "so the homepage and the products page, should be rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 275.31,
          "end": 277.8,
          "en": "We do that by going to this root layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 277.8,
          "end": 280.53,
          "en": "and importing another special thing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 280.53,
          "end": 284.43,
          "en": "another special component from react-router-dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 284.43,
          "end": 287.313,
          "en": "And that's the outlet component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 288.9,
          "end": 291.06,
          "en": "This component marks the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 291.06,
          "end": 295.47,
          "en": "where the child route elements should be rendered to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 295.47,
          "end": 300.47,
          "en": "And here we could, for example, add a fragment, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 300.54,
          "end": 304.44,
          "en": "And then here, add this H1 tag where we say root layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 304.44,
          "end": 306.513,
          "en": "And below that, we have the outlet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 307.38,
          "end": 309.69,
          "en": "So, this is now the marker, the place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 309.69,
          "end": 312.9,
          "en": "where the child routes should be rendered to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 312.9,
          "end": 315.48,
          "en": "So in our case, that would be the homepage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 315.48,
          "end": 317.73,
          "en": "and the products page components, in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 318.87,
          "end": 322.44,
          "en": "With that, if we save that, we see root layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 322.44,
          "end": 324.6,
          "en": "and below that, my homepage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 324.6,
          "end": 325.89,
          "en": "And if I go to products,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 325.89,
          "end": 328.89,
          "en": "we see root layout and the products page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 328.89,
          "end": 331.92,
          "en": "So now, we are rendering this parent element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 331.92,
          "end": 335.013,
          "en": "and then the appropriate child elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 336.03,
          "end": 338.97,
          "en": "The advantage of this approach is that this root layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 338.97,
          "end": 341.52,
          "en": "now, indeed, does act as a wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 341.52,
          "end": 343.353,
          "en": "for these page components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 344.37,
          "end": 346.5,
          "en": "So therefore, here, instead of displaying",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 346.5,
          "end": 348.39,
          "en": "this dummy root layout text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 348.39,
          "end": 351.24,
          "en": "we can include the main navigation component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 351.24,
          "end": 353.79,
          "en": "by importing it from our components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 353.79,
          "end": 355.683,
          "en": "and rendering it above the outlet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 356.88,
          "end": 361.86,
          "en": "If we do that, we see the navigation, here, above our pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 361.86,
          "end": 364.62,
          "en": "and now we got this navigation on all the pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 364.62,
          "end": 367.02,
          "en": "and all the pages we might add here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 367.02,
          "end": 369.99,
          "en": "to this children array, in the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 369.99,
          "end": 373.44,
          "en": "And having such a root route, that acts as a layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 373.44,
          "end": 376.38,
          "en": "is totally standard and totally normal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 376.38,
          "end": 378.57,
          "en": "when using React router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 378.57,
          "end": 380.82,
          "en": "You implement layouts like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 380.82,
          "end": 383.4,
          "en": "by adding wrapping routes like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 383.4,
          "end": 385.65,
          "en": "And, of course, for more complex pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 385.65,
          "end": 388.38,
          "en": "you could have multiple root routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 388.38,
          "end": 390.66,
          "en": "for example, one for slash admin,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 390.66,
          "end": 393.322,
          "en": "which then has a totally different set of children,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 393.322,
          "end": 395.55,
          "en": "which might have a different layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 395.55,
          "end": 397.38,
          "en": "that's wrapped around them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
